        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86358, Bar Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bar Cabinet Pull is available in 10 sizes ranging from 3 inches to 24 inches. It will fit most cabinet doors as well as other lightweight doors and drawers on furniture and vanities. The Bar Pull is available in a wide array of modern finishes. The ladder shape is one of the most popular for door handles because of its ability to look good no matter what the decor around it. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Bar Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Cabinet Pull Diameter: 1/2\" all sizes</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\" all sizes</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/8\" all sizes</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86358-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262381\"><b>Emtek Bar Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 10 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86358:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86359:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86360:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86361:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86362:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86363:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86364:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86365:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86366:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86387:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 26-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 24\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86358-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354738\" width=\"510\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
